<title>GERMANY: DTB to trade Telekom options from Wednesday.</title>
<headline>DTB to trade Telekom options from Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German futures and options exchange Deutsche Terminboerse will trade options on the new Deutsche Telekom AG share from Wednesday, German bourse head Werner Seifert told a news conference in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>Telekom will be listed on bourses in Germany and New York today and in Tokyo from Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
